SUMMARY:Cultural events in Daugavpils Unity House
DESCRIPTION:The Unity House is the organiser of many events in Daugavpils. 
 It actively works on implementing cultural projects and serves as a guardi
 an of Latvia’s cultural heritage. The Unity House organises educational 
 and entertainment events\, celebrations\, and concerts\, and contributes t
 o the preservation\, promotion\, and accessibility of cultural values.
