UID:11424@visitdaugavpils.lv
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Riga:20261121T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Riga:20261121T160000
DTSTAMP:20260223T111407Z
URL:https://www.visitdaugavpils.lv/pasakumi/tirdzins-rigas-iela-39/
SUMMARY:Rīgas Street Market
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, November 21\, from 10:00 to 16:00\, the tradition
 al Rīgas Street Market will take place in Daugavpils. Traders from Latvia
 \, Lithuania\, and other countries will offer a wide range of products —
  homemade bread and pastries\, honey and beekeeping goods\, herbal teas\, 
 spices\, cheeses\, sweets\, and various sea buckthorn\, hemp\, and lavende
 r products.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.visitdaugavpils.lv/wp-content/upload
 s/2026/02/Rigas-ielas-tirdzins-4-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Svētki un festivāli,Kultūra,Izklaide,Bērniem,Citi pasākumi
END:VEVENT
